      "name": "Artifact preview",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "artifact-preview",
      "description": "A working artifact with type, excerpt, audience and revision.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-artifact\"><span>Working document ↗</span><strong>Community meeting brief</strong><p>Agree on the next community activity and the resources we can share.</p><small>Common room · Revision 1</small></button>",
      "css": ".ds-artifact{font-family:\"Inter Variable\",Inter,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:190px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line, #e1ddd7);border-radius:8px;background:var(--panel, #ffffff);color:var(--ink, #242329);text-align:left;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;cursor:pointer}.ds-artifact>span{font-size:.6875rem;color:var(--ink-muted, #69636d);margin-bottom:16px}.ds-artifact>strong{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}.ds-artifact>p{color:var(--ink-muted, #69636d);font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.65;margin:10px 0 0}.ds-artifact>small{color:var(--ink-muted, #69636d);font-size:.6875rem;margin-top:auto;padding-top:18px}.ds-artifact:hover{border-color:var(--green, #8a5638)}.ds-artifact:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green, #8a5638);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-artifact{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversation composer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "One bordered writing plane with the accent send action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer\"><textarea aria-label=\"Message Aksara\" placeholder=\"Message Aksara…\"></textarea><button aria-label=\"Send message\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5m-6 6 6-6 6 6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;border:1px solid var(--line, #e1ddd7);border-radius:9px;padding:9px;background:var(--panel, #ffffff)}.ds-composer textarea{font-family:\"Inter Variable\",Inter,sans-serif;flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:30px;max-height:160px;resize:none;border:0;background:transparent;padding:5px 4px;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink, #242329);outline:none;caret-color:var(--green, #8a5638)}.ds-composer textarea::placeholder{color:var(--ink-muted, #69636d);opacity:1}.ds-composer button{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:var(--green, #8a5638);color:var(--primary-foreground, #ffffff);cursor:pointer}.ds-composer button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green, #8a5638);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-composer button:disabled{opacity:.48;cursor:default}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-composer textarea{font-size:1rem}.ds-composer button{width:38px;height:38px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Shared Workbench",
    "overview": "Aksara is an industrial editorial workbench: warm neutral planes, exact alignment, readable semibold titles and restrained copper emphasis. The retained open-triangle mark and Inter interface give conversation, documents and tools one recognizable family. Density supports real work while leaving the active artifact room to read and edit.\n\nFlat surfaces and hairline boundaries provide structure. Light appearance uses warm paper and a deep copper accent; dark appearance uses graphite and muted copper. Twenty UI supplies shared control behavior; the workspace supplies its semantic colors and spatial grammar. Georgia remains a reading voice for rich-document paragraphs.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Broad working planes with compact supporting context.",
      "Inter interface, semibold titles and serif rich-document paragraphs.",
      "Copper selection and actions on paper or graphite.",
      "Quiet borders, modest corners and explicit audience and save state."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Shared Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use the active semantic accent for actions, focus, selection and working state. Honor saved palette choices; do not hardcode copper into a reusable control.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Voices Rule",
        "body": "Keep interface text and document titles in Inter. Reserve Georgia for rich-document paragraph reading.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workbench Rule",
        "body": "Keep working planes flat. Use shadows to distinguish temporary overlays from the workspace.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep audience, revision, source context and save state readable beside the work.",
      "Do use semantic colors across controls, editors and portaled menus.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus, reduced motion and mobile safe-area spacing.",
      "Do use artifact previews for work and compact rows for settings, capabilities and activity."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reintroduce atmospheric wallpaper or decorative blobs into the workspace.",
      "Don't turn every row into a floating card or spread settings across a wall of columns.",
      "Don't substitute blue-slate surfaces for the graphite palette.",
      "Don't imply live collaboration, real contributors or model activity through fabricated presence or content."
    ]
  }
}
